  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 - First release of the rewritten engine. Perlin, OpenSimplex2, Value and Cellular noise for 2D and 3D; fBm, ridged and ping-pong fractals; domain warping; a batched composition graph; single-point, grid, volume and parallel APIs. Scalar, SIMD and parallel backends produce bit-identical output.",
